<title>USA: StorMedia says court stays Maxtor suit.</title>
<headline>StorMedia says court stays Maxtor suit.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif. 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>StorMedia Inc said Wednesday a State District Court in Colorado had stayed Maxtor Corp's lawsuit against StorMedia pending resolution of StorMedia's lawsuit against Hyundai Electronics Industries Ltd.</p>
<p>On September 25, 1996, StorMedia said it had sued Hyundai for breach of contract and was seeking damages in excess of $206 million.</p>
<p>Maxtor filed its suit on December 19, 1996, alleging breach of contract and actual damages of more than $100 million and seeking punitive damages.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
